  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Detailed Design and Supervision of Marin Barleti Street and Lumbardhi Cinema in Prizren, Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Purpose of the contract is preparation of detailed design and unit price works tender dossier for the reconstruction works in Marin Barleti Street and Lumbardhi cinema, which are situated in historic centre of Prizren and are heritage sites. The assignment includes, in addition, complete supervision as set out in PRAG conditions and rules of the construction works, including supervision during the defect liability period.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
